Error [jet.UseAfterMove]: `holder.res` was consumed by the move `^holder.res`, so it can't be used here
  --> holder_field_partial_move_is_recorded.jet:13:22
    |
 13 |     print(holder.res.name)
    |                      ^^^^
  --> holder_field_partial_move_is_recorded.jet:12:18
    |
 12 |     grab(^holder.res)
    |                  ^^^ `holder.res` moved to the move `^holder.res` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `holder.res` after the move, or give the move `^holder.res` a copy with `holder.res.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
